The Africa team struggled under the burning sun

00:57:31.320 --> 00:57:35.320
and driving winds that are hallmarks of the Sahara.

00:57:41.320 --> 00:57:44.320
They went home with an enormous admiration for the creatures

00:57:44.320 --> 00:57:50.320
